          "module_id": "sec11-m04",
          "unit_id": "sec11-u04",
          "front": "What happens when drivers fall asleep, and how do drowsy drivers appear?",
          "back": "Many crashes each year happen because a driver falls asleep at the wheel, often ending in a head on crash with another vehicle, a tree or a roadside object, and drowsy drivers can drive so poorly that they appear drunk.",
          "memory_hook": "Falling asleep at the wheel",
          "hook_origin": "minted",
          "difficulty": "medium",
