          "front": "What are the signs of drowsy driving?",
          "back": "Signs of drowsy driving are trouble focusing or keeping the eyes open, repeated yawning, not remembering the last few miles, drifting out of the lane and missing traffic signs.",
          "memory_hook": "Signs of drowsy driving",
